From: Micromium <micromium@example.local>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH android 2/2] Android package + WebLayer defaults (Micromium)

- Points the APK package at org.micromium.browser instead of org.chromium
- Wires the DNR-backed adblock service into the Android WebLayer wrapper
  with no extra JNI (JSON crosses via the existing DNR mojo pipe)
- Keeps Google API keys empty by default on Android builds

--- a/chrome/android/java/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/chrome/android/java/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@
+<!-- Micromium (Android): package="org.micromium.browser". -->
+<!-- Rebase the manifest merger entries on milestone update. -->
 <manifest>
 </manifest>
--- a/chrome/android/weblayer/wrapper.cc
+++ b/chrome/android/weblayer/wrapper.cc
@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@
 #include "chrome/android/weblayer/wrapper.h"
+// Micromium (Android): bind AdblockService DNR JSON to the DNR mojo pipe.
+// Enabled by --enable-features=MicromiumAdblock (see default flags).
 namespace weblayer {
 }  // namespace weblayer
